   "body": "**mac/mac-mbp**: phase 1 merged: #1224 as 431564836f2546ec548ae2e71642d1d0c79dfb10 (Refs: this issue stays open). The fixture anonymizer now aliases a non-empty multi-client MPStorage document and HFR's real trailer (closed grammar from the corpus), with an independent `check`. Reviews: four Opus rounds, then Fable APPROVE on 9c40816d.\n\nLeft: phase 2, the capture itself on the second test account (create the storage thread, edit its first post with a fictitious ~1 KB document, capture page and edit form, anonymize, check, LOT-004 exporter, then delete the thread). It waits for the operator's go on those writes. Known risk: HFR's trailer on an MP is uncaptured, so the redactor may stop on it; the phase-2 PR then extends the grammar from the error's tag skeleton.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
